// Security Eventlog Cleared | T1685.005 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/builtin/security/win_security_audit_log_cleared.yml
(EventID:517 AND Provider_Name:Security) OR (EventID:1102 AND Provider_Name:Microsoft\-Windows\-Eventlog)

